  <Sequence sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText="Runs the full scenario loop for one application row from the Applications sheet: launch app, dispatch every enabled TC_&lt;AppName&gt; scenario (SendEmail / VerifyReceive / VerifyReceiveAttachment), build+send the per-app holistic summary email, then close/clean up. Per-app Try/Catch/Finally ensures one app's crash never stops the others." DisplayName="Process">
